        "Same reference through both chains.\n\nTOP (blue): the new single node — YuNet inside OpenCV on the CPU, selection by confidence, full frame as fallback.\n\nBOTTOM (red): the current production chain with prod parameters (threshold 0.7, crop_factor 2, keep largest by area).\n\nOn a box whose cached YOLO has degraded, the bottom preview shows a small patch of background while the top one shows the face. Right after a ComfyUI restart both look correct — that is the tell: the weights rot in place, not on disk.\n\nfallback_image_opt is wired on SEGSToImageList so an empty detection previews the source instead of erroring."
